{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_title", "source_sha256": "da1e091f25f6f9642d498de57e00603c615fbd267667e78e7efa3d442b67ba39", "ja": "茜とおでかけ1", "zh": "和茜一起外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ba3bb22bc3d1d976aa038a6d532c6db43c81fe9f8f9bc50b17c43c9eb65507eb", "ja": "茜とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和茜一同出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "effebb1ffd82766a79431cc3523a9080a56f132926d5915eb828111495629e85", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、奈良の公園ロケ。休憩中、鹿の\nおやつのせんべいを大量に買った茜は、案の定……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是在奈良公园进行外景拍摄。休息时，买了大量鹿吃的仙贝的茜，果然……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "d762826a4645d8c22d8335784d72788b644b3ea1e8492642ad5310d50ac14cf1", "ja": "せ、生還……！　いくら茜ちゃんがカワイイからって、\n鹿ちゃんたち、ワイルド・ラブが過ぎるよ！", "zh": "活、活下来了……！就算小茜很可爱，鹿鹿们也不能爱得这么狂野吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "54651e62e90c676dd6ec43fdf6e0274b74d5ef5ca5586deca58e246b5d7b08e8", "ja": "欲張ってせんべいをあんなに買うから……\n何にせよ、無事で良かった。", "zh": "都是因为贪心买了那么多仙贝……\n不管怎么说，没事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "caf09da8f6a94fb8cc8935e3f0b723be6acd4a52579d73a6949ab94ab42c1ffd", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんが助けてくれなかったら\n茜ちゃんの命はなかったね！　断言するよ！", "zh": "要不是{$P$}救了我，\n小茜这条小命就没了呢！茜敢打包票！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cc30e14f2c619fd52826ab9402fd5925ab957fdc844682711a70cf8ee842d4e2", "ja": "断言されても困るんだが。それより茜、\nそろそろ撮影が始まるけど、段取りは大丈夫か？", "zh": "就算你这么断言我也很伤脑筋啊。比起那个，茜，\n拍摄差不多要开始了，流程步骤没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "03b8aefb1565e2e78ec68e8a02bd8be285b7e8c1155517021d5569bac08f3194", "ja": "それはもちろん！　……んにゃ？\n{$P$}ちゃん、台本は！？", "zh": "当然没问题！……嗯喵？\n{$P$}，剧本呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "88c13318767c1b33ae0c01c10fc67a998b5c5c35eca5d3c347e125255fd4cf93", "ja": "ここにあるよ。……もしかして、\n鹿騒動のせいで全部忘れたんじゃ……。", "zh": "在这里哦。……难道说，你因为那场鹿骚动，把台词全忘了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "de2235e5ff605a24ca6bdba979e998442c4d3b9c0ee4775672acaee604efa478", "ja": "そそそそんなことないけど？　茜ちゃんは\nプロだし、直前まで台本読み込んじゃう的な！？", "zh": "才才才没有那回事吧？　小茜可是专业的嘛，会一直把剧本读到上场前之类的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "5b2d8b900c12d8a85101f611bf6f38414020a95012cfc8fcfdb89031ed7ab92a", "ja": "それにしても、鹿ってカワイイけど意外と力が\nあるんだね……茜ちゃん、勉強になったよ……。", "zh": "话说回来，鹿虽然很可爱，力气却意外地大呢……小茜，真是让我长见识了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_023aka01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_023aka01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b0759c2f3eaafc8d75bda9a47ebdc68c1a75d2faf38a3aa1fbe084e23a6a6324", "ja": "（台本を読みながら、遠い目をしているな……。\n何にせよ、茜が無事で良かった！）", "zh": "（一边看着剧本，一边露出望向远方的眼神……不管怎么说，茜平安无事就好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
